    "sections": {
        "description": "STLogistic is a modern, lightweight, and fully responsive WordPress theme designed for logistics companies, transportation services, freight agencies, warehouse businesses, and supply chain providers. Built with clean code and optimized performance, the theme delivers a smooth browsing experience across all devices. The theme features customizable sections and blog support, helping you create a professional logistics website with ease. STLogistic is compatible with popular page builders and supports WooCommerce, making it ideal for shipment services, transport bookings, and logistics management. Whether you run a logistics company, cargo service, or supply chain business, STLogistic provides a stylish and flexible foundation for your online presence."
    },
